{"server":"cn","storyId":"act31side_level_act31side_st02","groupId":"act31side","stageId":"act31side_st02","title":"织锦缎","storyCode":"HS-ST-2","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act31side/level_act31side_st02.txt","sourceHash":"5a200a68a5403e3270e04b80541fcd74f9f4e08f2f37fc7a0ba2126a8ff7cd08","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"黍牺牲了自己的生命来清除大荒城地底的邪魔污染。就当人们以为威胁散去的时候，绩将一株被邪魔污染的水稻投入了大荒城的核心能源。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经丑时了......这局是谁赢了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"自己数数。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都说过，我不擅长这个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那你应该学学。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要见你一面可不容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这古寺深寒，二哥倒是不改其道......你天天把自己关在这屋子里对着这副棋盘，到底在上面看出什么来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"和你在那账本上看到的，差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"棋盘上有同一种规则，棋盘外，也是一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天下熙熙，皆为利来；天下攘攘，皆为利往......二哥琢磨得通透。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些年来，兄弟姐妹几个，自从找到各自感兴趣的事后，好像都活得越来越惬意了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老头子好像终于参透了“武道”，转身去北疆守城，大姐一梦千年四处神游，好不自在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......除了那个姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多少年来......我还是为她不值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看来是你最近的生意做得太顺，才有功夫操心这么多事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是最近才想明白一个道理，学会了一种活法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天地者，万物之逆旅也，光阴者，百代之过客也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人活一世，无非是找到一处寄托，名心不化，这一生也就过去了。寿命长短，也无所谓什么区别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你要是真的看透了，就不会坐在这。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你想说什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你想做的事，我能帮你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我也要借你一样东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二哥何必客气，只要是我有的，需要什么拿去就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"把你的命给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g7_fieldhouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女性","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你运气真好。花下一禾生......就叫你“禾生”吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女性","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以后你就留在这吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_mini01_villagevacancy"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女性","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的土地，种不出庄稼了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女性","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到那些黑色的石头了吗，有这些东西在的地方，粮食长不出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女性","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"种不出粮食，就有人要饿肚子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女性","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有许多人，许多年来都在想办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女性","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要学习吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女性","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这可能会花很多时间，可能你付出了一生的努力，都不会看到结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温柔的女性","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便如此，你也不后悔吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g2_desertedcityfield_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"最近发生了许多事，原本熟悉的土地仿佛已经变成了人们不认识的样子。古老的田地马上就要完成翻新，又偏偏天意弄人，灾异不断。\n田边颓坐的职农抬起头，雨水落在他的脸上，清凉，温和。\n田里伏倒的庄稼也挺直了腰杆，枝叶变回了青翠的绿色。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊讶的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊讶的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"神农，是神农......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊讶的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"神农真的回来了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g4_factory_outside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你怎么躺在这？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"醒醒，喂，醒醒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么又换上这身衣服了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......现在是什么时候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"离我们上次碰面过去了半天，你让我去查粮仓里的庄稼，还说自己要去找把大荒城搞得满城风雨的罪魁祸首——怎么倒在这了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那现在呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"粮仓里的庄稼有没有被污染，找到污染源在哪里了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一点都没看到......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去到粮仓，发现之前夏收收上来的庄稼全都变成了诡异的红黑色......不止这个，田里的地都变成了板结的盐碱地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可不知道怎么回事，刚刚下了一场雨，土地全都恢复原状，粮仓里的粮食也变成了正常的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就好像，有谁用了夸张的源石技艺，把污染全都清除了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地下的污染？谁能做到这种事......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们现在，应该安全了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这场雨......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黍在哪里？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说......谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的老师呢？她在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天师府的老师有好几位，你在说谁......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g5_factory_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这都是你做的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她消失了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底想做什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么要来问我呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留在这里，守在这里，自始至终都是她自己的选择。我何曾干涉过分毫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把她禁锢在这片土地千年之久的，难道不是“人”吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是疯了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和那个臭棋篓子是打算送死，还要拉上所有人陪你们一起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来我的妹妹们是真的在这人间玩得太久太开心，忘了自己到底是谁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这出假装自己不是异类的戏，你们还要演多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小夕......你在画里待了那么长时间，心气还这么浮躁，这可不是当世第一的画家该有的心境吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有年，这么长时间，我还从来没见过你这么认真的样子，原来你还是很在乎自己的兄弟姐妹的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会杀了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我说过，我是来帮你们的......咳咳......你们为什么，就不相信呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们不是想要做成这个，能支持我们存在的能量的容器？“巨兽的心脏”？我来告诉你们它缺了什么东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别过来。如果还想要命的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在实在不太有功夫来解开这个误会......只能稍微委屈你们一下了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g5_factory_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么能控制这个装置？你是什么时候——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的能力本就是同源的，何况在怎么对付自己的分身上，我专门学习了一些经验。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多少是有些冒险的办法，会有些副作用，也是无可奈何。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也该大荒城有这么一劫，总不能自己种下的恶因，最后全靠别人付出生命来收这个恶果......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哪有这样便宜的好事。"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人伸出手，一株漆黑的稻穗出现在掌中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“形”“意”“因果”，你们三人加起来，听上去确实能做出一些逆天改命的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐她永远是这样，相信只要辛勤耕种灌溉，总能得出善果。相信这世上美多过丑，善多过恶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可为什么生命降生时，总是伴随着啼哭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人也好，兽也罢，羸弱的生命来到这苍茫世上，感知到的第一种情绪，只能是恐惧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该醒来了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人将黑色的稻穗投入身前巨大的装置。\n紧接着，一颗心脏跳动起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
